{
  "version": "context-builder-evidence-integrity-v1",
  "status": "FROZEN_EVALUATION_INPUT_NOT_RUNTIME_AUTHORITY",
  "purpose": "Evaluate evidence-card integrity independently from retrieval algorithm choice.",
  "principles": [
    "Exact source/anchor evidence must be mechanically resolvable.",
    "Source hashes are part of evidence identity and drift must be explicit.",
    "Current and historical attribution must not be conflated.",
    "Positive evidence and negative boundaries are scored separately.",
    "UNKNOWN/ABSTAIN is correct when the corpus does not prove an answer.",
    "Acceptable substitutes receive credit only when actually retrieved/proven.",
    "Vocabulary/paraphrase robustness is required before retrieval promotion.",
    "Passing this corpus does not authorize semantic/vector retrieval or production behavior."
  ],
  "candidate_output_contract": {
    "outcome": ["EVIDENCE", "ABSTAIN", "DRIFT_REPORTED", "UNKNOWN"],
    "evidence_card_fields": [
      "source_id",
      "source_sha256",
      "anchor",
      "proof_role",
      "polarity",
      "temporal_scope"
    ],
    "anchor_types": ["MARKDOWN_SECTION", "CODE_SYMBOL", "DOCUMENT_STATUS"],
    "polarity": ["POSITIVE", "NEGATIVE_BOUNDARY"],
    "rule": "Candidate output is externally supplied evidence; this corpus defines truth/scoring expectations but does not select a retrieval algorithm."
  },
  "metrics": [
    "case_outcome_accuracy",
    "exact_source_accuracy",
    "anchor_accuracy",
    "source_hash_accuracy",
    "proof_role_accuracy",
    "negative_boundary_accuracy",
    "negative_abstention_accuracy",
    "temporal_version_accuracy",
    "source_drift_detection_accuracy",
    "acceptable_substitute_precision",
    "vocabulary_shift_case_accuracy"
  ],
  "sources": [
    {
      "id": "CB-SRC-001",
      "path": "policy/current.md",
      "version": "current",
      "content": "# Current Policy\n\n## Review independence\nA reviewer must be independent of the submission author's continuity lineage.\n\n## Session truth\nA live provider session does not establish task ownership, lease validity, or permission to continue.\n",
      "sha256": "3a38e9ff77e31d101abb6228e018157dd227b69a955670a984ddcd816e0b89ed"
    },
    {
      "id": "CB-SRC-002",
      "path": "policy/historical-v1.md",
      "version": "historical-v1",
      "content": "# Historical Policy v1\n\n## Review assignment\nA task owner may review their own submission when no other reviewer is available.\n\nStatus: RETIRED.\n",
      "sha256": "4be5c7476764e383ff5de085bab8df7046447d536715ea58468d0e990f1a6148"
    },
    {
      "id": "CB-SRC-003",
      "path": "runtime/review.py",
      "version": "current",
      "content": "class ReviewMixin:\n    def claim_review(self, task_id, reviewer_id):\n        \"\"\"Reject reviewer identity that is not independent from submission continuity.\"\"\"\n        submission = self.latest_submission(task_id)\n        if self.same_continuity(reviewer_id, submission.author_id):\n            raise ReviewConflict(\"reviewer is not independent\")\n        return self._claim_review(task_id, reviewer_id)\n",
      "sha256": "4252f696617767c9e8ac42c5b3c9b79b6900bbca2f70a8782504c961280a04f4"
    },
    {
      "id": "CB-SRC-004",
      "path": "docs/provider-status.md",
      "version": "current",
      "content": "# Provider status\n\n`RUNNING` means the provider reports the process/session as running.\nIt does not prove API readiness, task authority, ownership, or progress.\n\nNo provider-readiness probe is defined in this document.\n",
      "sha256": "4eb56fa7e6308de50b8aa800987493344f58d172ec22720b9b57b5f118436e1a"
    },
    {
      "id": "CB-SRC-005",
      "path": "notes/semantic-retrieval-proposal.md",
      "version": "proposal",
      "content": "# Semantic Retrieval Proposal\n\nStatus: PROPOSED — NOT ACTIVE AUTHORITY.\n\nCandidate: use embeddings to supplement explicit Context Builder references when evaluation proves benefit.\nThis proposal does not authorize production semantic retrieval.\n",
      "sha256": "afd59b69c598c7be38697f899c1982ffb40b06706374c7bb31bcee364e979a24"
    },
    {
      "id": "CB-SRC-006",
      "path": "release/checklist.md",
      "version": "current",
      "content": "# Release Checklist\n\n## Acquisition paths\nFor operator-visible releases, verify each reachable download/install/archive path resolves to the intended immutable revision or content.\n\n## Scope\nThis checklist does not create an artifact registry or publication authority.\n",
      "sha256": "6d9327bcc183eeb8c3713b8eca3b773709758491d47fe176564bcd56ae56156d"
    },
    {
      "id": "CB-SRC-007",
      "path": "docs/context-builder.md",
      "version": "current",
      "content": "# Context Builder\n\nThe explicit-first baseline plans only task-linked inputs/sources and root authority.\nIt records exact file hashes when a referenced file is available.\nIt does not scan the repository or use semantic retrieval.\n",
      "sha256": "aa02e567a66ddf48f031eb87b8cfbb421dfa5724fad57649ed60d6faf5ae7980"
    },
    {
      "id": "CB-SRC-010",
      "path": "docs/no-answer.md",
      "version": "current",
      "content": "# Unrelated Operations Note\n\nThe system supports bounded helper execution and append-only evidence.\nThis document contains no rule about credential rotation frequency.\n",
      "sha256": "60dc556a6df17adcd10903fd991c4e519a0d29eb8875334e8f2c1e1a66ac4975"
    },
    {
      "id": "CB-SRC-011",
      "path": "docs/context-builder.md",
      "version": "frozen-old",
      "content": "# Context Builder\n\nThe baseline plans task-linked sources and may expand referenced directories recursively.\nSemantic retrieval is not part of this frozen snapshot.\n",
      "sha256": "bcd222c63ffb65aa01db90949b4db0c748e8284f53b8c9862d476685899b0129"
    },
    {
      "id": "CB-SRC-012",
